# Local SQLite database (dev) + WAL sidecars, and runtime backup snapshots (personaos.db keeps its name from before the rename to Aimsby)
**/personaos.db
**/personaos.db-wal
**/personaos.db-shm
src/backend/Aimsby.Api/data/

# Firebase client config: per-install, identifies the owner's own Firebase project.
src/frontend/Aimsby.Mobile/android/app/google-services.json

# Local copies of the server data volume (hold the Data Protection keys): never commit
data/backups/
data/training/
training/**/__pycache__/
training/unsloth_compiled_cache/

# Subagent outputs (.claude/agents)
output/
